# Wave W17-AB (Route 224): head floor — the champion’s road pale sand, design-authorised: a pale stone-dust sand running from the League’s door east to the white stone, cool and grey in its grit where the coast’s rock has ground itself into the tread (design: the stone coast east of the League — the road is walked by champions and kept by the Stone Keeper). Split from Route 222’s solar sand by temperature entire (stone-cool vs sun-bleached warm) and from Route 225’s worn sand by keeping: this sand is swept pale, that one is trampled hard.
